    "body": "When I create a file, I found that the file with the same name can't be created if the case is different, I briefly tested the `vim.loop.fs_stat` function, and it doesn't seem to recognize the case accurately.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e24ec1fcf885990fec1a993fe8304a033fd1806d/lua/mini/files.lua#L2356\r\n\r\nI'm not sure. Can you check for me?",
